{# Neutral notice for a "Re-check DNS" POST that landed inside the cooldown
   window (DEC-059). Impatience — or a second tab with a stale, still-enabled
   button — is normal behaviour, not an error, so this renders as info and
   never as alert-error.

   Rendered by every page dashboard_domain_reverify can redirect back to, so
   the user always learns why nothing appeared to happen. #}
{% for message in app.flashes('domain_recheck') %}
    <div class="alert alert-info mb-4" data-testid="domain-recheck-notice">
        <span>{{ message }}</span>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
